 "transcriber_notes": "Measured on the embedded 6160x2832 chart raster (surface line y=299.5, 0 cm y=2751.5, 18.03 px/cm); boundaries printed on the right axis and every bar edge agrees with them. Hardness from bar left edges vs gridlines (I/K/P/1F/4F/F at 707/967/1227/1487/1747/2007 px, 260 px per class; thirds as +/-). Temperatures are break points of the unmarked red polyline (Douglas-Peucker on the line centre, +-0.1 C / +-0.5 cm), calibrated with x = 2115.5 + 46.80*T(C). Air temp '--' so no dashed air-temperature segment; the fit calibration puts every break point on a 0.5 C step. Straight segment 80-0 cm may hide collinear points. Water content column blank for all layers; no density column. One test box (bold 'CT12 RP') with a dashed leader at 117 cm."
